        <condition/>
        <description>Create Client Script that makes incident State "Closed" not selectable for anyone who holds "itil" role.&#13;
Test Scenarios and expected results:&#13;
1. Impersonate user holding "itil" role (but not holding "admin" role) - incident State "Closed" should&#13;
not be selectable&#13;
2. With your admin account you should be able to select incident State "Closed</description>
        <field>state</field>
        <global>true</global>
        <isolate_script>true</isolate_script>
        <messages/>
        <name>Task08</name>
        <order/>
        <script><![CDATA[function onChange(control, oldValue, newValue, isLoading, isTemplate) {
   if (isLoading || newValue === '') {
      return;
   }

   var isItil = g_user.hasRole('itil');
   var isAdmin = g_user.hasRole('admin');
   var state = g_form.getValue('state');
   alert(state);

   if(isItil && !isAdmin){
	state = false;
   }else{
	state = true;
   }
}]]></script>
